  "details": "1. Log into VRChat using the Open Beta version\n\n2. Equip / load the affected avatar\n\n3. Open the expression menu. Toggles are missing\n\n4. Switch to the Stable version\n\n5. Load the same avatar. Toggles are present and avatar looks correct\n\nThe avatar should look the same in both versions and all toggles should be available. In the Open Beta the avatar looks visually different and the toggles are not present in the expression menu. The avatar was uploaded approximately one year ago and has not been modified since. Other players on the Stable version see the avatar correctly\n\nSwitching from Open Beta to Stable resolves the issue.",
